
# Python bytecode from the guardrail gates (ci/gates/, sync/)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The documentation build. docs/src/generated/ is copied in from the report, the
# derivations, the ledgers and upstream/ by docs/make.jl, so that the site cannot drift
# from them. The docs manifest is not committed: the root Manifest.toml is the one whose
# versions are part of the result (DECISIONS.md D-0003).
/docs/build/
/docs/src/generated/
/docs/Manifest.toml
